  "historyNote": "#8685, eff 7-21-06; renumbered by #9206 (formerly He-W 403.08); ss by #10639, INTERIM, eff 7-21-14, EXPIRES: 1-19-15; ss by #10760, eff 1-19-15; ss by #14275, eff 6-24-25, EXPIRES: 6-24-35",
